#==============================================================================================
#
#   replaced_element_common - Painting: where a replaced element's content is painted
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/ReplacedElementCommon.cpp (lines 1-99): the device rect a
#       replaced element's content (an image, a video frame, a canvas) is painted into, sized
#       by object-fit and placed by object-position within the paintable's content box.
